OL,3,GNEWSA'I want to use the voice I've     
OL,4,Aalways been scared of'                 
OL,6,FAfter undergoing a pioneering operation
OL,7,Fto treat her paralysed vocal cords, a  
OL,8,Fteenager keen on drama said she hoped  
OL,9,Fthe procedure would restore the voice  
OL,10,Fshe had always been "scared to use".   
OL,12,FCharlotte, 15, from Higham Ferrers,    
OL,13,FNorthamptonshire, was believed to be   
OL,14,Fthe first patient in the East Midlands 
OL,15,Fregion to have laryngeal reinnervation 
OL,16,Fsurgery.                               
OL,18,FIt involved connecting a healthy nerve 
OL,19,Fin the neck to the damaged nerve       
OL,20,Fcontrolling the voice box.             
