OL,3,GNEWSA'I want to use the voice I've     
OL,4,Aalways been scared of'                 
OL,6,FOne of her surgeons said that given her
OL,7,Fage, the prognosis was good, and       
OL,8,FCharlotte said people were already     
OL,9,Fstarting to notice her voice was       
OL,10,Fgetting louder.                        
